Z||000000||RiceCooker||05-08-2001||02:05 PM||||Well, how was it?<P>Did we get more cars than Edmonton again?<P>Didja miss me?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Did everyone get Tonsilitis from the restaurant?||||reg||5
Z||000001||FLASHY||05-08-2001||03:16 PM||||We had a great time! The wind was incredible the whole way there. You could tell when you were almost about to get blown off the highway when the first 6 or 7 fieros ahead of you started shifting and swaying around. Fun stuff! It turned out that we had more Calgary fieros again than the Edmonton ones. I think 10 for Calgary, 6 for Edmonton...could be off by one or two. Originally it was thought to be the other way around. We didn't get sick this time because we ate at Willy's instead. We did however stop at Rockin' Robin's for a shake before heading back (which tasted yummy by the way). So ya it was fun!<P>Are you going to be able to make it to Willy's this Thursday? It's about time you did.||||reg||14
Z||000002||Gasolene||05-09-2001||10:04 AM||||Edmonton will beat Calgary next time we meet.<P>We just took over the club a couple weeks ago as the head guy left for the East Coast, so things are kinda unorganized.<P><P>------------------<BR>------------------------<BR>Gasolene!!!<BR>Edmonton Fiero Club <A HREF="http://www.angelfire.com/ab5/efog/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.angelfire.com/ab5/efog/</A>  <BR>Gasolene's Custom stereo install <A HREF="http://www.angelfire.com/ab4/fierostereo/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.angelfire.com/ab4/fierostereo/</A> ||||reg||1
