Z||000005||RiceCooker||05-09-2001||04:15 PM||||I will try to be there tomorrow night. My Car is working/shifting great! It doesn't even grind at all going into reverse anymore - which tells me that my release lever WAS bent for a long time before it broke. <P>But i still feel sheepish about the whole amp thing. It's not my fault but ****, one thing after another, is my car cursed?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/confused.gif"><P>It's trying to make me hate it, but it's not gonna work. hahaha.<P>Don't worry Flashy, I'm not gonna beat you up, I gotta break out the big guns for Voytek! hahaha.<P>See ya tomorrow<P>------------------<BR>This is my witty signature,<BR>It makes me cool||||reg||6
